   "score": 0,
   "created_utc": "2016-01-18T05:02:58Z",
   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "Could we write the new_Stack function like this?   <code>long * new_Stack (unsigned long size) {      long * this_stack = (long *) ((size + STACK_NUM) * sizeof(long));      return this_stack; }</code>  Why we need a void pointer if I may ask?  <i>PS</i> : I don&#39;t know how to put the codes in new lines :("
  },
  {
   "post_type": "comment",
   "post_id": 57435362,
   "parent_id": 34847499,
   "parent_type": "answer",
