   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
   "body_html": "Actually, it calls <code>free</code> 5 times on <code>(&amp;stack)[i]</code>, then <code>&amp;stack</code>. Which is just wrong since <code>stack</code> is a local variable."
